WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inspect stored evidence. At P′ = 1.10, the score bound is below the eligible cutoff.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Move the pressure. The transported interval changes immediately, using arithmetic from the source root.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A wider interval can overlap the cutoff. In that case the executor needs a fresh numerical test.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Change the eligible ranking cutoff. When the bound falls below it, a fresh evaluation can be skipped.
